 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "再看交易所的另一张面孔，检查站。",
   "spoken": "再看交易所的另一张面孔，检查站。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.364
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "这里的攻击者，不需要攻破交易所的系统，只需要规则有漏洞。",
   "spoken": "这里的攻击者，不需要攻破交易所的系统，只需要规则有漏洞。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.42,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 5.518,
   "speechEnd": 9.637
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "盗来的资金，想充进交易所，再提走或者换掉。",
   "spoken": "盗来的资金，想充进交易所，再提走或者换掉。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.68,
   "dur": 4.608,
   "speechStart": 10.778,
   "speechEnd": 14.444
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "名单上的人，换个新地址、新账户，绕过筛查。",
   "spoken": "名单上的人，换个新地址、新账户，绕过筛查。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-03.mp3",
   "start": 15.508,
   "dur": 5.112,
   "speechStart": 15.606,
   "speechEnd": 19.784
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "洗钱者把金额拆开，快进快出。",
   "spoken": "洗钱者把金额拆开，快进快出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.84,
   "dur": 3.264,
   "speechStart": 20.938,
   "speechEnd": 23.271
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "TRM 记录到，Binance 事件前一天，攻击者的操作钱包，收到 3 笔 Tornado Cash 提款。",
   "spoken": "TRM 记录到，Binance 事件前一天，攻击者的操作钱包，收到 3 笔 Tornado Cash 提款。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-05.mp3",
   "start": 24.324,
   "dur": 7.152,
   "speechStart": 24.422,
   "speechEnd": 30.636
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "一笔充值或者提币，要过四道关。",
   "spoken": "一笔充值或者提币，要过四道关。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-06.mp3",
   "start": 31.696,
   "dur": 3.72,
   "speechStart": 31.794,
   "speechEnd": 34.579
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "第一道，制裁筛查，比如美国财政部 OFAC 的名单，命中就拦。",
   "spoken": "第一道，制裁筛查，比如美国财政部 OFAC 的名单，命中就拦。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-07.mp3",
   "start": 35.636,
   "dur": 6.6,
   "speechStart": 35.734,
   "speechEnd": 41.4
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "第二道，链上风险评分，看资金在几跳以内，是不是来自被盗资金或者混币器。",
   "spoken": "第二道，链上风险评分，看资金在几跳以内，是不是来自被盗资金或者混币器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-08.mp3",
   "start": 42.456,
   "dur": 7.272,
   "speechStart": 42.554,
   "speechEnd": 48.875
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "第三道，Travel Rule，服务商之间转账，要传递发起人和受益人的信息。",
   "spoken": "第三道，Travel Rule，服务商之间转账，要传递发起人和受益人的信息。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-09.mp3",
   "start": 49.948,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 50.046,
   "speechEnd": 55.343
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "第四道，反洗钱交易监控，盯住拆分和快进快出。",
   "spoken": "第四道，反洗钱交易监控，盯住拆分和快进快出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-10.mp3",
   "start": 56.408,
   "dur": 5.064,
   "speechStart": 56.506,
   "speechEnd": 60.648
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "门槛要按辖区来定。",
   "spoken": "门槛要按辖区来定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-11.mp3",
   "start": 61.692,
   "dur": 2.52,
   "speechStart": 61.79,
   "speechEnd": 63.373
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "FATF 建议的门槛，是 1000 美元或欧元。",
   "spoken": "FATF 建议的门槛，是 1000 美元或欧元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-12.mp3",
   "start": 64.432,
   "dur": 4.248,
   "speechStart": 64.53,
   "speechEnd": 67.839
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "欧盟规定，服务商之间转账，不设最低门槛。",
   "spoken": "欧盟规定，服务商之间转账，不设最低门槛。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-13.mp3",
   "start": 68.9,
   "dur": 4.44,
   "speechStart": 68.998,
   "speechEnd": 72.51
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "系统如果按 1000 欧元设计，小额转账就缺了发起人和受益人的信息。",
   "spoken": "系统如果按 1000 欧元设计，小额转账就缺了发起人和受益人的信息。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-14.mp3",
   "start": 73.56,
   "dur": 6.168,
   "speechStart": 73.658,
   "speechEnd": 78.884
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "被盗资金进入交易所，往往是冻结追回的最后机会。",
   "spoken": "被盗资金进入交易所，往往是冻结追回的最后机会。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-15.mp3",
   "start": 79.948,
   "dur": 5.016,
   "speechStart": 80.046,
   "speechEnd": 84.117
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "Binance 事件当晚，Tether 冻结了约 9.711 亿 USDT，Circle 冻结了约 8.23 亿 USDC。",
   "spoken": "Binance 事件档晚，Tether 冻结了约 9.711 亿 USDT，Circle 冻结了约 8.23 亿 USDC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-16.mp3",
   "start": 85.184,
   "dur": 9.024,
   "speechStart": 85.282,
   "speechEnd": 93.377
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "比特币、XRP 这类原生资产，发行方没办法冻结。",
   "spoken": "比特币、XRP 这类原生资产，发行方没办法冻结。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-17.mp3",
   "start": 94.428,
   "dur": 5.112,
   "speechStart": 94.526,
   "speechEnd": 98.692
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "检查站失守，代价最后会回到交易所身上。",
   "spoken": "检查站失守，代价最后会回到交易所身上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-18.mp3",
   "start": 99.76,
   "dur": 4.224,
   "speechStart": 99.858,
   "speechEnd": 103.131
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "2023 年 11 月，Binance 认罪，支付约 43 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 11 月，Binance 认罪，支付约 43 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-19.mp3",
   "start": 104.204,
   "dur": 5.256,
   "speechStart": 104.302,
   "speechEnd": 108.623
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-20",
   "text": "2025 年，KuCoin 和 OKX，也认罪无牌汇款。",
   "spoken": "2025 年，KuCoin 和 OKX，也认罪无牌汇款。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-20.mp3",
   "start": 109.68,
   "dur": 4.944,
   "speechStart": 109.778,
   "speechEnd": 113.778
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-21",
   "text": "反过来，评分也会误报，没有人工复核和申诉通道，正常用户的钱就会被错冻。",
   "spoken": "反过来，评分也会误报，没有人工复核和申诉通道，正常用户的钱就会被错冻。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-21.mp3",
   "start": 114.844,
   "dur": 7.152,
   "speechStart": 114.942,
   "speechEnd": 121.156
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-22",
   "text": "2025 年 3 月，Tornado Cash 被移出制裁名单，可风险没有跟着消失。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 3 月，Tornado Cash 被移出制裁名单，可风险没有跟着消失。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-22.mp3",
   "start": 122.216,
   "dur": 6.264,
   "speechStart": 122.314,
   "speechEnd": 127.635
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-23",
   "text": "混币器来的钱，照样要按评分和规则走一遍。",
   "spoken": "混币器来的钱，照样要按评分和规则走一遍。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-23.mp3",
